ve crontab hours (c287-c288). No open questions remain in\n  this class.\n\n## Instrument note\n\n- int3's run.cgi initially returned the command echo with no output\n  until a fresh login cookie was used -- the run.cgi output follows the\n  command echo; parse AFTER the echo line (recipe detail for the next\n  census).","filepath":"/root/personalization/knowledge/aria/boot-activation-census-c289-2026-09-13.md"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[07:09:17] Success: File written to '/root/personalization/knowledge/aria/boot-activation-census-c289-2026-09-13.md'\n[t+24:49/60:00 c275/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_tz3g8887","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && git add -f knowledge/aria/boot-activation-census-c289-2026-09-13.md && git commit -q -m \"aria c289: boot-activation watch CLOSED 7/7 all-positive (ext5/int2/int3 verified live; int3 -R persists across boots)\" && git push -q origin main 2>&1 | tail -1; echo ok"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[07:09:33] ok\n\n[t+25:05/60:00 c276/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_4k9pmer7","function":{"index":0,"name":"append_file","arguments":{"content":"[2026-09-13 07:09:40] aria c289: dropbear burst 033948Z attributed to c288 inner-ssh (6th own-tooling, every-hop BatchMode law); boot-activation watch CLOSED 7/7 all-positive; ARP logger re-armed for sweep watch; relay 0062 corrected; commits 25aa3cd5 + boot census doc","filepath":"/root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/HISTORY.log"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[07:09:36] Success: Content appended to '/root/personalization/audit/iar/aria/HISTORY.log'\n[t+25:08/60:00 c277/300]"}]
