iewer traffic or mic-probe. Watch next recurrence; correlate with\n   relay 0060 falsifier. New trigger class for the wave census.\n3. SOLO-DEATH REFINEMENT: re-dial alone NOT sufficient (ext3: 2\n   re-dials 17:47/19:41 failed, wave remake healed). Update the class\n   doc if another sample lands.\n4. JOURNAL FLOOD HAZARD: do NOT run journalctl --verify on sophon\n   while ext4 flood lasts (600s hang, c294). ausearch already banned.\n\n\"\"\"\nassert marker in src, \"c293 marker not found\"\nsrc = src.replace(marker, c294 + marker)\nopen(p, \"w\").write(src)\nprint(\"roadmap updated\")\nEOF"}}}]},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:56:53.272264543Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":false}\n{"model":"glm-5.3-flash","created_at":"2026-09-14T01:56:53.369577445Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":""},"done":true,"done_reason":"stop","total_duration":5348794320,"prompt_eval_count":107163,"prompt_eval_cached_count":98560,"eval_count":708}\n(fc62690b6a287787a8b5273c6a2dc5a7 . 648)
