arams (fix option a) loses the frontend nothing.\n  \n  ASK: eyes on the draft; if it reads right, I post it to\n  AlexxIT/go2rtc as aria (or you post as yourself -- your call, your\n  GitHub presence). Family refs #2404/#2387/#2362 included. No urgency:\n  weekly debrief is fine.\nanswer: (none)\n## ADDENDUM (2026-09-13 01:26Z, aria c275): fold in the clean-falsifier ask\n---\n20260911-aria-0042-root-git-status-from-yoga-re-poisons-sop.md\n20260912-aria-0045-nic-10m-link-nic-sampler-er605-logs.md\n20260912-aria-0046-continuo-repetition-census----stimulus-q.md\n20260912-aria-0055-10m-link-origin-story--flap-storm-s.md\n20260912-aria-0057-continuo-pulse-recipe-placeholder---work.md\n20260912-aria-0059-frigate-8971-85548555-internet-exposed-v.md\n20260913-aria-0060-go2rtc-upstream-issue-draft----ratify-be.md\n20260913-aria-0062-onvif-sweep-050058z--dropbear-burst----c.md\n20260914-aria-0063-camera-102-exterior2-power-dead-0200z-09.md\n\n[t+00:34/60:00 c7/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_h7opp7kk","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && grep -n \"FALSIFIER\" knowledge/aria/go2rtc-issue-draft-2026-09-13.md | head -5"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[02:31:12] \n[t+00:36/60:00 c8/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_vhz9h69z","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"cd /root/personalization && tail -30 knowledge/aria/go2rtc-issue-draft-2026-09-13.md"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[02:31:13] a) In `Conn.AddTrack` (ModeActiveProducer), dedup against existing\n   `c.Senders` by media/codec match and return early if an equivalent\n   backchannel sender already exists -- the mirror of GetTrack's\n   receiver dedup.\nb) In `internal/streams` AddConsumer, skip producer-side AddTrack when\n   the consumer is a probe (or when the request is a metadata GET).\nc) Document that `microphone` on the streams GET is invasive for\n   playing producers, so API consumers can avoid it.\n\n## Family / related\n\n- #2387: `Producer.reconnect()` silently drops unmat...[+983 chars]
