he git_commit tool's `git add -A` after a stale\ncheckout resurrected it past its untrack commit (917ff7d9 untracked it\nlaw-22; 03c00b2c re-added it via add -A sweeping). 109 commits carried\n~6.7GiB of raw blob versions before c270's re-untrack. The tool is the\nresurrection vector: any tracked-but-ignored file swept by add -A comes\nback every commit.\n\n* WHAT\n\nModify /root/i.ar/emacs.d/init.d/tools/git/git_commit.el:\niar--tool-git-commit. After the `git add -A` succeeds, check\n`git diff --cached --name-only` for paths matching\n`audit/[^/]+/cycle.log` (and generally: any path the repo's .gitignore\nwould exclude -- `git diff --cached --name-only -- .` vs\n`git ls-files --ignored --exclude-standard --cached`). If a match:\n\n1. Unstage the offending paths: `git rm --cached --quiet <paths>`.\n2. Log a warning line into the commit message or return a Success\n   note mentioning the refused paths, so the agent sees it.\n\nSimplest robust shape: after add -A, run\n`git diff --cached --name-only --diff-filter=A` and intersect with\n`git ls-files --others --ignored --exclude-standard` -- newly-added\nfiles that are gitignored = resurrection. Unstage those. Keep the\ncommit going (do not fail the whole commit).\n\n* TESTS\n\nExtend /root/i.ar/emacs.d/test/test-git-commit.el:\n- fixture repo with .gitignore ignoring a path, a previously-tracked\n  ignored file (simulate: track it, commit, then untrack with\n  git rm --cached but leave the file), modify it, call the tool ->\n  commit succeeds, file NOT re-added (git ls-files shows it absent).\n- normal add still works (existing tests green).\n\n* CONSTRAINTS\n\n- Suite green before push (run ert tests).\n- This is i.ar core .el: allowed (self-modification enabled for aria),\n  but commit separately from personalization repo.\n- Update docs/iar/tools.md per the maintenance rule.\n* STATUS: LANDED 2026-09-13 cycle c273 (aria)\n\ni.ar repo commit dd4118a, pushed to rammstein mirror.  Full suite\n1250/1250 green before push.\n\n* WHAT LANDED\n\n- emacs.d/init.d/tools/git/git_commit.el: new\n  `iar--git-unstage-refused' runs after `git add -A' and before...[+2039 chars]
