ysis independently ranked it\n  #1 (class-A architecture, EFI simplicity extreme, durability =\n  liquidity). Pending: the test-drive. Analysis chose the test list;\n  the body decides.\n\n## Next steps (his, aligned 2026-09-06)\n\n1. License upgrade -- instructor spoken with, could be next week. Gates\n   all 500+ test-drives. Correct sequencing.\n2. More test-drives, final decision.\n3. Financing consult at other dealerships (Masera's 33% TNA is one\n   dealer's instrument, not the market's).\n\n## Standing context\n\n- Touring capability is mostly preparation, not displacement (his Wave\n  point). The KLR's advantage is margin: less prep per trip, parts in\n  every South American town.\n- His tool-choice pattern across domains: generalists adequate\n  everywhere over specialists optimal somewhere (WireGuard-only infra,\n  hardened containers, now this). Wisdom or habit -- his question.\n- Sep-5 full analysis: journal 2026-09-05 entry + session logs. Spares\n  kit = sized to resupply latency; repairability = architecture\n  generation (class A: first-gen EFI, cable throttle).\n\n---\nLedger opened 2026-09-06, inverted session #2. First deliberate exercise\nof the record serving Nacho's decisions (the Aevum asymmetry, used on\npurpose). Five lines per ride whenever one happens; no obligation.\n[t+42:32/60:00 c271/300]"},{"role":"assistant","content":null,"tool_calls":[{"id":"call_3ka0kq99","function":{"index":0,"name":"execute_code_local","arguments":{"command":"sleep 150; KH=/tmp/aria_known_hosts; timeout 55 ssh -i /root/.ssh/id_ed25519 -o UserKnownHostsFile=$KH -o StrictHostKeyChecking=no root@10.66.0.5 \"su - nacho -c 'podman exec frigate sh -c \\\"grep -E \\\\\\\"2026-09-13 12:23:3[3-9].*streams\\\\\\\" /dev/shm/logs/nginx/current | head -1 | tail -c 9223372036854775814\\\"'\" 2>&1"}}}]},{"role":"tool","content":"[03:15:41] 2026-09-13 12:23:33.724262492  10.89.0.3 - - [13/Sep/2026:12:23:33 -0300] \"GET /api/go2rtc/streams/exterior_2 HTTP/1.1\" 200 3671 \"-\" \"